WEBVTT

00:01.940 --> 00:03.520
"WELL,

00:03.860 --> 00:05.610
LET'S MEET AGAIN SOMEWHERE."

00:06.240 --> 00:09.820
AND THEN THEY PARTED WAYS.

00:10.620 --> 00:13.120
EACH WITH THEIR OWN DESTINY,

00:13.990 --> 00:17.000
THEY MEET AGAIN...

00:19.290 --> 00:20.460
THE WORLD BEGINS

00:20.460 --> 00:24.750
ON A NEW BATTLEFIELD.

00:45.740 --> 00:48.620
The last battlefield between you and I,

00:48.620 --> 00:49.750
or perhaps...

00:49.750 --> 00:52.110
OUR LAST CRUSADE OR THE RISE OF A NEW WORLD
...the crusade where the world begins.

00:52.110 --> 00:54.030
OUR LAST CRUSADE OR THE RISE OF A NEW WORLD

00:54.030 --> 00:56.040
SEASON 2

00:56.580 --> 00:56.990
EPISODE 1: WITCH, FATE OF THE STARS

00:56.990 --> 00:59.570
EPISODE 1: WITCH, FATE OF THE STARS
Thank you for using our service.

00:59.570 --> 01:02.330
EPISODE 1: WITCH, FATE OF THE STARS

01:02.330 --> 01:04.420
I've found you, Sisbell!

01:05.530 --> 01:06.840
What is it?

01:07.270 --> 01:08.770
Big sister Alice.

01:09.220 --> 01:11.030
You must go back to the Imperial Palace.

01:11.030 --> 01:12.830
It's not safe here after a fight like—

01:12.830 --> 01:14.530
I'm not going back.

01:14.530 --> 01:15.860
Sisbell!

01:16.300 --> 01:17.220
You must go back!

01:17.590 --> 01:18.430
I won't!

01:19.310 --> 01:22.090
Because I have my own guard.

01:23.210 --> 01:24.310
Guard?

01:25.430 --> 01:26.710
You mean Shuvalts?

01:26.710 --> 01:29.110
It's none of your business, big sister.

01:29.110 --> 01:31.110
But our mother is worried about you too.

01:31.110 --> 01:35.190
If so, could you please
give this letter to mother?

01:35.190 --> 01:37.040
You're very well prepared for this...

01:37.450 --> 01:39.790
Big sister Alice, you're...

01:40.420 --> 01:41.410
...my rival after all!

01:41.940 --> 01:45.420
Because I will not give up my position
as the next queen or having him...

01:45.920 --> 01:47.420
...as my guard!

01:52.290 --> 01:54.050
W-Wait a minute, Sisbell!

01:54.050 --> 01:55.800
Could it be the guard you mean is...

01:55.800 --> 01:57.930
Is not Iska, right?!

01:59.750 --> 02:01.010
What's wrong, Iska?

02:01.430 --> 02:03.140
Ah, it's nothing.

02:03.500 --> 02:06.360
It's out, big brother Iska, Jhin.

02:06.360 --> 02:07.840
The other's day attack.

02:10.570 --> 02:12.900
After going through the verge
of death so many times,

02:12.900 --> 02:15.140
I thought we finally
got our decent vacation...

02:15.140 --> 02:16.410
I'm really sorry.

02:17.660 --> 02:19.270
Why are you kneeling like that?

02:19.270 --> 02:21.270
To show my apology...

02:21.270 --> 02:25.120
It's the Imperial Place's fault for attacking
a place that wasn't even a battlefield.

02:25.120 --> 02:30.030
The witch whom Iska broke out of jail
a year ago was here, of all places.

02:30.030 --> 02:31.670
What kind of coincidence is that?

02:32.090 --> 02:35.430
It was really a coincidence
that we met in this country.

02:35.430 --> 02:36.630
Of course it was.

02:36.630 --> 02:40.060
If it wasn't a coincidence,
we'd have been followed.

02:40.060 --> 02:42.910
I don't remember making a blunder like that.

02:42.910 --> 02:46.020
Well, if the Lord Mask is after that witch,

02:46.420 --> 02:48.670
we're safe here.

02:48.670 --> 02:52.580
Maybe that child already left the country
after escaping from the Lord Mask.

02:52.580 --> 02:54.030
I hope so.

02:55.420 --> 02:57.350
Is the boss back yet?

02:57.350 --> 02:59.030
I'll go check on her.

02:59.460 --> 03:02.120
I know where she is, so let me handle it.

03:02.120 --> 03:04.540
Now, off I go!

03:05.020 --> 03:09.040
You are the one who leaked
the destination of Sisbell to the Empire

03:09.040 --> 03:10.710
and the Zoa family, right?

03:10.710 --> 03:12.510
And one more thing...

03:12.510 --> 03:15.440
Are you a real Elletear?

03:18.420 --> 03:21.720
What are you talking about,
Your Majesty the Queen?

03:21.720 --> 03:25.770
Please don't say such funny
things with that serious face.

03:25.770 --> 03:28.860
Sisbell was ordered on a top-secret mission.

03:29.300 --> 03:33.400
The reason was that Alsamira
might be connected to the Empire.

03:33.400 --> 03:36.700
But somehow the Zoa family knew about this.

03:38.110 --> 03:42.290
The three houses of the Imperial Palace
are not exactly in solidarity.

03:42.700 --> 03:46.370
Because they have to fight
for the queen's selection.

03:46.370 --> 03:49.290
It seems you know the relationship
between the three royal families.

03:49.290 --> 03:50.670
Of course.

03:50.670 --> 03:55.170
The Lou family, fighting against the Empire,
has suppressed the sacrifices.

03:55.170 --> 03:56.990
The Hydra family, likewise,

03:56.990 --> 04:01.180
has supported the queen
as an excellent opinionator.

04:01.950 --> 04:03.600
The Zoa family, however,

04:03.600 --> 04:08.440
are extremists who want
to destroy the Empire at any cost.

04:08.440 --> 04:12.730
The Zoa family has a particularly difficult
relationship with the Lou family.

04:12.730 --> 04:15.110
If you were the real Elletear,

04:15.110 --> 04:18.700
you would not have told the Zoa family
where Sisbell was going.

04:22.660 --> 04:26.950
I can't take it,
Your Majesty the Queen.

04:26.950 --> 04:30.880
Ah, no. I mean...
The fake queen.

04:31.370 --> 04:33.960
That's an excellent recreation you made.

04:34.420 --> 04:39.130
Maybe Alice and Sisbell
would have been fooled a bit.

04:39.710 --> 04:42.640
That's enough, right?

04:45.010 --> 04:47.670
H-How did you know?

04:48.060 --> 04:51.350
Because it looks like my star spirit.

04:51.740 --> 04:54.530
But it's so much better than mine.

04:54.530 --> 04:55.610
That's not true!

04:55.610 --> 04:57.110
I really envy you.

04:58.490 --> 05:03.200
Elletear, please forgive me
for what I have just done.

05:04.450 --> 05:06.950
That was very fun entertainment.

05:06.950 --> 05:10.320
I just want to make sure
that you are not a fake.

05:10.320 --> 05:12.540
But, of course,
you have seen through it.

05:15.030 --> 05:18.330
Please stop, Lady Alice!
You shouldn't run in the hallways!

05:18.330 --> 05:20.530
It can't be helped since it's an emergency!

05:21.090 --> 05:25.050
Your Majesty the Queen! I have an urgent
matter to discuss with you about Sisbell!

05:27.350 --> 05:29.410
This is happiness...

05:29.410 --> 05:30.810
I knew it.

05:30.810 --> 05:32.100
How about your training?

05:32.100 --> 05:35.210
Ah, Nene. Of course I did that.

05:35.210 --> 05:37.690
I worked up a sweat at the gym

05:37.690 --> 05:39.770
and swam as hard as I could in the pool.

05:39.770 --> 05:40.950
Captain.

05:40.950 --> 05:42.150
I can see your body clearly.

05:42.940 --> 05:44.460
I knew it, captain.

05:44.460 --> 05:47.190
People like you are called "exhibitionists."

05:47.190 --> 05:48.900
That's right.

05:49.730 --> 05:51.070
I can see it.

05:51.540 --> 05:53.540
And you can't hide it from me.

05:54.240 --> 05:55.420
The star's crest.

05:57.500 --> 05:59.170
Hey! What are you doing?!

05:59.580 --> 06:04.260
Ah, forgive my rudeness.
But I have something for you.

06:04.260 --> 06:06.930
It's not enough for the Empire, is it?

06:06.930 --> 06:11.070
That would leave your invisible
star spirit energy leaking out.

06:11.070 --> 06:12.620
Would you let me do it?

06:16.310 --> 06:17.960
W-Wait!

06:19.860 --> 06:21.900
I'll be waiting for you in the café.

06:22.580 --> 06:24.360
Big sister Elletear...

06:24.360 --> 06:28.590
It's hard to talk about Sisbell
with me around, isn't it?

06:28.590 --> 06:31.270
I am a "suspect," after all.

06:31.690 --> 06:33.990
I will take my leave,
Your Majesty the Queen.

06:41.190 --> 06:43.530
What do you want to discuss, Alice?

06:44.340 --> 06:46.880
This letter is to Her Majesty the Queen.

06:49.690 --> 06:52.020
It's become troublesome.

06:52.020 --> 06:55.600
Sisbell's connection to the Empire
has been suspected.

06:55.600 --> 06:57.890
And now, there's Lord Mask.

06:57.890 --> 06:58.920
Yes.

06:59.440 --> 07:03.860
For the Zoa family, this is an excellent
opportunity to aim for the next queen.

07:03.860 --> 07:07.490
But why didn't Sisbell come back with you?

07:07.490 --> 07:10.390
If she returned to the castle with me,
it would be conspicuous.

07:10.390 --> 07:12.540
So she would return by a different route.

07:12.930 --> 07:14.910
I'll send her a guard.

07:14.910 --> 07:17.680
By the way, according to this letter...

07:17.680 --> 07:20.790
She mentions that you were reunited
in Alsamira with an Imperial soldier

07:20.790 --> 07:23.510
who helped Sisbell a year ago.

07:23.510 --> 07:26.900
Do you know this Imperial soldier?

07:26.900 --> 07:28.430
No, I do not.

07:28.880 --> 07:30.640
I didn't meet him in Alsamira,

07:30.640 --> 07:33.560
and I didn't meet him
on the battlefield or in a Neutral City.

07:33.560 --> 07:36.500
Uh, Rin, is there anything else?

07:36.500 --> 07:38.780
I think it would be wise
not to talk too much.

07:38.780 --> 07:43.030
So, Mother, I don't know anything about him.

07:43.030 --> 07:46.860
I don't know a single thing
about this Iska or something!

07:47.780 --> 07:49.450
Understood.

07:50.180 --> 07:54.620
Thank you for gathering here.
Captain Mismis, Iska,

07:54.990 --> 07:55.830
Nene,

07:56.420 --> 07:57.680
and Jhin.

07:58.180 --> 08:01.340
I've heard about you.
Tell me what you want.

08:01.340 --> 08:03.180
Why don't you sit down first?

08:03.180 --> 08:04.760
Do you think there are any seats?

08:05.150 --> 08:06.340
Here.

08:06.340 --> 08:09.180
Could it be that you don't like
to sit with a witch?

08:09.180 --> 08:12.720
If you have something to say,
I don't mind sitting or not.

08:12.720 --> 08:14.520
Tell me about your business first.

08:14.520 --> 08:17.810
I thought you had fled the country long ago.

08:17.810 --> 08:20.860
Yes. I'm going to the Imperial Palace.

08:21.460 --> 08:23.480
With you all, okay?

08:25.110 --> 08:26.110
What?

08:26.510 --> 08:28.470
I want you to be my guard.

08:28.470 --> 08:33.140
Please eliminate the star spirit troops
until I return to the royal palace.

08:33.140 --> 08:34.990
What?!

08:34.990 --> 08:38.510
I refuse. We're screwed if
the headquarters finds out

08:38.510 --> 08:40.670
that we are escorting you
to the Imperial Palace.

08:40.670 --> 08:41.220
Liar.

08:41.220 --> 08:42.030
What?

08:42.030 --> 08:43.420
What you don't want them to know

08:43.420 --> 08:46.380
is that Captain Mismis is a witch, right?

08:46.380 --> 08:47.870
So you knew?

08:47.870 --> 08:48.770
Yes.

08:49.890 --> 08:52.450
It is a special material called Nebula.

08:52.450 --> 08:55.300
There is no material in the Empire
yet that can prevent

08:55.300 --> 08:57.480
the leakage of star spirit energy.

08:57.920 --> 08:58.980
Yeah.

08:58.980 --> 09:00.770
In return for being my guard,

09:00.770 --> 09:04.230
I will provide you with a seal
that will conceal her star's crest.

09:04.230 --> 09:07.230
I'm not asking you to betray the Empire.

09:07.870 --> 09:11.950
The people who want to kill me
are the star spirit users of the Imperial Palace.

09:11.950 --> 09:15.440
It is only logical that the Imperial Army
would fight against a star spirit user,

09:15.440 --> 09:16.450
right, Captain Mismis?

09:16.450 --> 09:18.330
T-That's...

09:18.750 --> 09:20.330
- That's enough.
- Okay, it's over.

09:20.330 --> 09:23.360
All right, Sisbell.
We have a deal.

09:23.360 --> 09:25.340
Isuka? Nene?

09:25.340 --> 09:27.230
It is our consensus.

09:27.700 --> 09:30.720
We don't think you're going
to accept that proposal.

09:30.720 --> 09:33.680
But we will help you.
So it's fine.

09:33.680 --> 09:36.560
No actions that would be
detrimental to the Empire.

09:36.560 --> 09:39.710
Intercept only when attacked
by a star spirit troops.

09:39.710 --> 09:43.470
If there is a situation where we are pursued
by imperial troops, we will leave them dead.

09:43.470 --> 09:45.060
Very well.

09:45.060 --> 09:47.840
It's a trade.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.760
The estimation is 30 days.

09:49.760 --> 09:50.880
Is that clear?

09:50.880 --> 09:52.290
I understand.

09:52.990 --> 09:54.620
Let me ask you one last time.

09:54.620 --> 09:56.830
Why are they after you?

09:59.450 --> 10:01.760
If I don't return to the palace,

10:01.760 --> 10:05.000
an all-out war between the Imperial Palace
and the Empire will break out.

10:05.000 --> 10:06.210
An all-ou—

10:06.610 --> 10:09.790
An all-out war between
the two countries will bring ruin.

10:09.790 --> 10:12.310
I want to return as soon as possible.

10:12.310 --> 10:13.970
What do you mean?

10:13.970 --> 10:16.300
I am the retainer of the royal family.

10:16.950 --> 10:19.600
There are people at the palace
who want to overthrow

10:19.600 --> 10:22.230
the current government and
start a war with the Empire.

10:22.230 --> 10:23.590
Lord Mask, huh?

10:24.420 --> 10:26.390
He is one of the suspects.

10:26.960 --> 10:30.830
My purpose is to identify the traitor.

10:30.830 --> 10:33.070
That's why I'm being targeted.

10:33.470 --> 10:35.740
I will pay for anything you order.

10:36.200 --> 10:38.740
Think of this as a token of our friendship.

10:39.140 --> 10:41.470
But we're not ordering anything.

10:41.470 --> 10:42.880
Now, let's go.

10:42.880 --> 10:44.500
Hey, at least listen to me.

10:44.500 --> 10:48.100
Lady Alice, is it okay to lie down and relax?

10:48.100 --> 10:49.590
It's a bed, so I'm fine.

10:49.590 --> 10:52.970
I'm saying it's a problem because
it's Lady Sisbell's room.

10:53.870 --> 10:57.220
I wonder where she is now.

10:57.220 --> 10:58.780
You will soon find out.

10:58.780 --> 11:02.030
The queen's guards
are on their way to protect her.

11:03.430 --> 11:08.010
What's the matter?
You sigh a very melancholy sigh.

11:08.010 --> 11:10.460
I can at least sigh. Geez.

11:10.890 --> 11:13.580
I'm attending a formal meeting,

11:13.580 --> 11:16.490
and as Sisbell's sister,
I'm worried about her

11:16.490 --> 11:19.760
and big sister Elletear.

11:19.760 --> 11:23.030
I don't have time to think
about anything else.

11:23.030 --> 11:25.580
I thought you skipped a lot of meetings.

11:26.310 --> 11:28.170
Please forgive my rudeness.

11:28.170 --> 11:31.490
I have to fight against the Apostle Saint
to protect the Imperial Palace.

11:31.490 --> 11:35.500
I'll have to face the strongest swordsman
of the former Apostle Saint.

11:35.500 --> 11:38.260
I am sure I will fight with him!

11:38.260 --> 11:40.050
- And then we'll see an opera

11:40.050 --> 11:41.500
- Why are you talking about him?
- or eat pasta together...

11:41.500 --> 11:42.810
- Why are you talking about him?

11:44.320 --> 11:48.460
I only recognize Iska as an enemy!

11:48.460 --> 11:50.990
When we meet on the battlefield,
there will be no mercy.

11:50.990 --> 11:52.820
That's right, Lady Alice.

11:52.820 --> 11:55.260
Me and Iska have no choice but to fight!

11:55.260 --> 11:59.200
And yet she says,
"You are the only ideal guard!"

11:59.980 --> 12:03.160
She wouldn't do it with Iska, would she?!

12:03.740 --> 12:04.240
- You've got to be kidding me!

12:04.240 --> 12:05.750
- Lady Alice, please consider your manners!
- You've got to be kidding me!

12:05.750 --> 12:06.630
- Lady Alice, please consider your manners!

12:08.670 --> 12:11.730
Everyone, please be on your toes.

12:11.730 --> 12:14.710
We never know where
the Lord Mask's assassins may be.

12:14.710 --> 12:17.680
But hey! You're clinging to Iska!

12:17.680 --> 12:18.180
Hey...

12:18.510 --> 12:20.210
This is the fate of the stars.

12:20.210 --> 12:24.170
I am sure we will have a good
master-servant relationship.

12:24.560 --> 12:26.310
W-What are you saying?!

12:26.740 --> 12:28.770
Iska is my subordinate!

12:28.770 --> 12:30.520
But I'm your guard.

12:30.520 --> 12:33.360
Oh, that's right.
I beg your pardon.

12:34.630 --> 12:36.570
Iska is our old friend!

12:36.570 --> 12:38.820
You can't just try
to take him away from us!

12:38.820 --> 12:40.990
But I'm your friend now.

12:42.460 --> 12:43.780
That aside...

12:44.730 --> 12:46.560
I am so reassured.

12:47.040 --> 12:50.040
I have only Shuvalts on my side.

12:52.980 --> 12:54.880
I-I'll let you do it this time!

12:55.230 --> 12:57.170
Well, it can't be helped.

12:57.170 --> 13:00.370
Sisbell, let me make this clear.

13:00.370 --> 13:03.390
When this escort is over,
we have no relation again.

13:03.890 --> 13:05.970
We are enemies on the battlefield.

13:06.510 --> 13:07.580
You know it, right?

13:08.570 --> 13:09.770
It's fine.

13:10.590 --> 13:14.450
Thank you for being my guard.

13:15.270 --> 13:19.340
I am so glad you are here.

13:21.870 --> 13:24.060
To avoid eye contact with the Zoa family.

13:24.060 --> 13:28.030
I have chosen the non-shortest
way to the Imperial Palace.

13:28.030 --> 13:30.860
We should spend the night here.

13:30.860 --> 13:34.960
That's wise, Shuvalts.
Besides, I'm hungry.

13:35.380 --> 13:36.570
Iska!

13:37.700 --> 13:41.630
There are many restaurants.
Which one would you like?

13:42.180 --> 13:44.240
I'm your guard.

13:44.240 --> 13:46.720
I'll follow you to
the restaurant of your choice.

13:46.720 --> 13:51.040
Anyway, if you're feeling better,
it's time for you to let go of my hand.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.770
That's...

13:52.770 --> 13:53.770
No chance!

13:53.770 --> 13:57.600
- This is a mission...
- We are her guards...

13:57.600 --> 13:59.940
You're leaking your murderous intent.

14:00.690 --> 14:05.350
That's right, Iska.
Guess my favorite food.

14:05.350 --> 14:07.740
That'll be our dinner tonight.

14:07.740 --> 14:09.190
Your favorite?

14:09.770 --> 14:13.070
It seems you're in trouble.
If it's too hard, I'll give you—

14:13.070 --> 14:14.250
Pasta.

14:14.590 --> 14:15.190
Huh?

14:15.630 --> 14:17.920
No way! How did you know that?!

14:18.430 --> 14:19.410
It's just a hunch.

14:21.990 --> 14:24.720
They are sisters, after all.

14:26.810 --> 14:28.210
How are you now,

14:29.780 --> 14:30.870
Alice?

14:31.520 --> 14:35.070
Maybe I should have
brought her home after all.

14:35.070 --> 14:36.230
Lady Alice.

14:36.810 --> 14:38.990
Sorry to bother you before bedtime.

14:38.990 --> 14:39.980
What is it?

14:40.470 --> 14:41.710
You have a guest.

14:41.710 --> 14:43.840
Should I refuse the guest?

14:43.840 --> 14:47.280
Yeah, you should do that.
It's late at night, after all.

14:47.940 --> 14:50.000
But, who is it?

14:50.370 --> 14:51.580
Lord Mask.

14:51.580 --> 14:52.870
My apologies.

14:53.390 --> 14:57.880
I apologize in advance
for any lack of courtesy.

14:58.700 --> 15:01.280
What do you want?

15:01.280 --> 15:07.430
Are you aware of the possibility that Sisbell
may be in touch with the Empire?

15:07.430 --> 15:08.220
No.

15:08.220 --> 15:11.450
If she is working with Imperial soldiers,

15:11.450 --> 15:13.270
it would be a betrayal.

15:13.730 --> 15:17.770
The queen will be disgraced.
And your position as princess.

15:17.770 --> 15:21.320
There is no way she is connected
to the Empire.

15:21.790 --> 15:22.860
Oh?

15:23.450 --> 15:26.080
Then why don't we search together?

15:26.080 --> 15:28.370
The outcome will be obvious.

15:30.240 --> 15:31.990
Understood.

15:33.680 --> 15:35.790
We finally at Imperial Palace.

15:37.330 --> 15:41.250
I told you. You don't need to
worry if I am with you.

15:41.250 --> 15:44.800
Is it safe to cross the border so easily?

15:45.230 --> 15:47.970
What if they are demanding our star crests?

15:47.970 --> 15:50.660
I would have yelled at them to leave.

15:50.660 --> 15:53.270
Of course, it would be
trouble if they found out...

15:55.370 --> 15:57.840
Even I am so desperate...

15:58.420 --> 16:00.650
The castle is now a nest of monsters.

16:01.130 --> 16:02.820
I must protect the queen.

16:02.820 --> 16:04.030
Monsters?

16:04.030 --> 16:06.380
No, I misspoke.

16:07.860 --> 16:08.700
Oh...

16:09.220 --> 16:11.580
What's wrong, Iska?

16:11.940 --> 16:16.000
Well, it's just that every
country has its own cafes.

16:16.780 --> 16:21.340
One hundred years ago, the Nebulis Imperial
Household was founded by star spirit users

16:21.340 --> 16:22.710
who fled the empire.

16:23.210 --> 16:25.210
The roots of civilization have not changed.

16:25.210 --> 16:29.420
If there are invisible differences
in language and culture,

16:29.420 --> 16:32.800
it is that everyone in
this city is a star spirit user.

16:33.260 --> 16:34.870
This is what I mean.

16:34.870 --> 16:38.780
Even that girl on the café terrace may be
able to use the threatening

16:38.780 --> 16:41.580
star spirit technique to overwhelm
the imperial soldiers.

16:42.380 --> 16:44.270
That is why the Empire

16:44.270 --> 16:48.280
has been persecuting spirit star users
as "witch" and "demon."

16:54.080 --> 16:58.210
The security is tight, but are they on
the lookout for invading imperial soldiers?

16:58.210 --> 16:59.770
No.

16:59.770 --> 17:03.370
They are now on patrol in all
the states to track down criminal

17:03.370 --> 17:05.960
who have escaped from prison.

17:05.960 --> 17:08.720
So they are not only on the lookout
for imperial soldiers.

17:08.720 --> 17:12.170
There will be those who misuse
guns in the Empire as well.

17:12.170 --> 17:15.660
Not all spirit star users
are true human beings.

17:15.660 --> 17:19.250
The one who escaped from prison
this time is the worst of the worst,

17:19.250 --> 17:21.310
a demon named Salinger.

17:21.310 --> 17:22.480
What?!

17:26.110 --> 17:30.050
Oh, Iska?
Something bothering you?

17:30.720 --> 17:32.250
Well, yeah.

17:32.250 --> 17:35.950
What we have to think about is our plan now.

17:36.350 --> 17:40.330
How do we get to the central states,
where the palace is located?

17:40.330 --> 17:43.500
You're right!
Here's where it gets real!

17:44.020 --> 17:46.710
She's on the move?!

17:47.530 --> 17:49.040
My clothes...

17:49.040 --> 17:51.150
How's Sisbell situation?!

17:51.150 --> 17:56.050
Today, she passed the border checkpoint
and entered the Imperial Palace.

17:56.050 --> 17:58.070
She and Shuvalts alone?

17:58.070 --> 18:00.490
There are four guards escorting her.

18:00.490 --> 18:04.270
It seems they were mercenaries
she hired in Alsamira.

18:04.270 --> 18:05.610
She did a great job!

18:06.010 --> 18:08.400
Sisbell did that?

18:08.400 --> 18:09.670
Yes.

18:10.250 --> 18:13.110
Yours are really splendid, Lady Alice?

18:13.110 --> 18:15.240
What are you talking about?

18:15.930 --> 18:19.380
She wants you to go to Riesbaden,

18:19.380 --> 18:21.790
where Sisbell is, for protection.

18:21.790 --> 18:25.210
Me? But there's Mask Lord.

18:25.210 --> 18:28.250
The queen will hold a blood
relative conference tomorrow.

18:28.640 --> 18:31.590
The Mask Lord of Zoa family will be there.

18:32.640 --> 18:35.330
So I can leave in the meantime.

18:35.790 --> 18:39.350
Huh? But I must participate too, right?

18:39.350 --> 18:41.850
Lady Elletear is here now.

18:42.320 --> 18:47.330
You're right. I honestly don't know
about her feeling yet.

18:47.330 --> 18:49.150
But she's my little sister.

18:49.490 --> 18:51.440
I have to help her.

18:53.130 --> 18:54.470
This is it.

18:54.870 --> 18:57.780
This is where the real strategy begins.

18:58.340 --> 19:02.500
Once I crossed the border,
my whereabouts would be known.

19:03.690 --> 19:06.810
I will know the traitor from the Zoa family

19:07.410 --> 19:11.670
who betrayed Big Sister Elletear and Alice.

19:12.220 --> 19:16.380
Furthermore, there is a strong possibility
that they are friends with that monster.

19:17.190 --> 19:20.790
If they are caught, they will
be imprisoned or silenced.

19:22.860 --> 19:25.360
The only person I can trust is my mother.

19:25.940 --> 19:28.850
That's why we wanted an escort.

19:29.700 --> 19:33.920
I was willing to seduce people
in order to protect this country.

19:34.410 --> 19:36.810
Even if they thought I was a filthy witch.

19:37.990 --> 19:41.310
But, mother, I...

19:41.740 --> 19:45.110
I'm so relieved to have
someone to hold on to.

19:48.940 --> 19:50.360
But I...

19:52.030 --> 19:53.040
I only...

19:53.820 --> 19:56.090
...have Iska right now.

19:56.570 --> 20:00.810
How happy I would be
if I could stay with him.

20:02.420 --> 20:04.180
Please guide me,

20:04.980 --> 20:06.990
star spirits.

20:08.690 --> 20:12.440
Where's your companion?
He's leaving so early.

20:12.860 --> 20:15.360
We just left for the central states.

20:15.730 --> 20:19.110
Shuvalts' star spirit is espionage.

20:19.650 --> 20:22.660
An audience with the Queen should
be granted the day after tomorrow.

20:22.660 --> 20:26.830
Let's hide out in this city
and wait for him to call us.

20:26.830 --> 20:27.960
Yeah.

20:28.310 --> 20:33.150
As arranged, I and Iska will keep an eye
on the South Altolia station.

20:33.150 --> 20:37.170
If assassins are coming,
they will probably use this railroad.

20:37.600 --> 20:40.910
It's an offensive self-defense
to find the assassins.

20:41.360 --> 20:42.340
It's just...

20:42.340 --> 20:44.720
I should hide my face, right?

20:44.720 --> 20:47.710
Here, put this on and good luck.

20:49.790 --> 20:51.540
This really fits me.

20:51.920 --> 20:53.440
You're so cool, Iska!

20:53.440 --> 20:55.780
And you looks so smart!

20:56.250 --> 20:57.740
I don't feel happy to hear that...

20:59.920 --> 21:02.400
We will arrive at the terminal
station at Riesbaden soon.

21:02.400 --> 21:04.490
South Altolia station to be precise.

21:04.490 --> 21:08.850
If Lady Sisbell were to hide out,
it would be in this city.

21:08.850 --> 21:11.230
Do you have any idea where she might go?

21:11.230 --> 21:13.500
If I did, we wouldn't have any trouble.

21:13.500 --> 21:16.760
She's always locked herself
in her room, hasn't she?

21:17.220 --> 21:19.300
I don't know what she likes after all.

21:19.300 --> 21:23.600
I don't know if she likes cake or pudding.

21:24.260 --> 21:26.700
We've arrived at South Altolia station.

21:26.700 --> 21:27.470
- Please don't forget your belonging.

21:27.470 --> 21:30.020
- Now, off we go, Rin!
- Please don't forget your belonging.

21:30.020 --> 21:33.860
Yes. Please wait me, Lady Alice.
This is heavy.

21:33.860 --> 21:36.930
It's going to take a lot
of work to find Sisbell!

21:36.930 --> 21:40.210
Please use your luck to find Sisbell.

21:40.210 --> 21:44.070
You'll have to make do with the power you've
got to keep meeting that swordsman.

21:44.070 --> 21:45.890
I met Iska on accident.

21:45.890 --> 21:50.040
But yes, it's fun to wonder
where Sisbell will stop.

21:50.040 --> 21:51.250
Over there!

21:51.820 --> 21:52.790
Huh?

21:52.790 --> 21:56.460
Really? There's a juice
bar in every terminal.

21:56.860 --> 22:00.020
It's hot and humid here
with all the pedestrians,

22:00.020 --> 22:04.010
and I'm sure you'll want to quench
your thirst with a refreshing juice.

22:04.010 --> 22:06.730
And we must drink something too,

22:06.730 --> 22:08.960
Now, let's check it out!

22:08.960 --> 22:11.690
You simply want a drink, Lady Alice...

22:11.690 --> 22:14.980
That's why I thought she might want one too.

22:15.780 --> 22:18.020
Oh, we missed.

22:18.020 --> 22:19.840
There is no way she is here.

22:19.840 --> 22:22.270
What do you want to order, Lady Alice?

22:22.270 --> 22:23.950
Hmm.. You're right.

22:23.950 --> 22:25.360
Green smoothies...

22:25.360 --> 22:26.700
- Excuse me.
- Banana juice.

22:27.120 --> 22:29.970
- One strawberry shake.
- Strawberry shake...

22:29.970 --> 22:30.950
- And...
- I've decided!

22:31.390 --> 22:34.300
Melon soda with special coconut ice cream.

22:34.300 --> 22:37.750
Topped with cream and enderflower syrup.

22:38.870 --> 22:39.550
Huh?

22:40.620 --> 22:41.340
Huh?

22:43.340 --> 22:44.190
Oh...

23:04.360 --> 23:10.620
OUR LAST CRUSADE OR
THE RISE OF A NEW WORLD SEASON 2
